Package: meteogal2fdata
Type: Package
Title: Download and Convert MeteoGalicia Observations to Functional Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Manuel", family = "Oviedo de la Fuente",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "manuel.oviedo@udc.es",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7360-3249"))
Description: Downloads daily meteorological observations from the
    MeteoGalicia station network through its documented daily JSON service,
    preserving the validation code of every measurement, and reads local
    historical observations. Provides station inventories, resumable
    calendar-month downloads to station-year files (with a provenance
    manifest), and conversion to base R data frames or functional data
    objects ('fdata' and 'ldata') from 'fda.usc'. Functional curves represent
    station-year combinations on a common 365-day grid; missing values are
    preserved, never imputed, and the daily validation codes and dates of each
    curve are kept in the 'ldata' metadata.
URL: https://github.com/moviedo5/meteogal2fdata
BugReports: https://github.com/moviedo5/meteogal2fdata/issues
